# AOI Creation & Route Planner

A web-based mapping application that helps users create routes by selecting multiple locations on an interactive map.

## Features

- Interactive map powered by OpenLayers and OpenStreetMap
- Add and delete location markers
- Calculate total distance between consecutive stops
- Estimate travel costs based on distance
- Finalize routes with a distance and cost summary
- Save marker data using browser local storage
- Progressive Web App (PWA) configuration

## Tech Stack

- React
- TypeScript
- Vite
- OpenLayers
- Tailwind CSS
- OpenStreetMap
- Vite PWA Plugin

## Getting Started

```bash
git clone YOUR_GITHUB_REPOSITORY_URL
cd aoi-creation-spa
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open the local URL displayed in your terminal to use the application.

## Build

```bash
npm run build
```

